  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "90",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math> <mrow> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math> be temperature of the middle point C and in the series, rate of heat flow is the same.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒ &nbsp; &nbsp;</mo><mi>K</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒ &nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>",
